{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strip Royale is a bold and unapologetically adult card game that fuses the classic gameplay of Snap with an immersive and realistic 3D strip experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off in intense rounds of Snap, matching cards and strategizing to rack up points. Each level challenges you to reach a set score\u2014if you succeed, your opponent, a beautifully rendered 3D model, will remove a piece of clothing. Your ultimate goal? Undress your rival completely and unlock a fully animated, explicit sex scene, unique to each character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl features her own set of detailed poses and positions. Earn enough points, choose the pose you want to watch, and experience an interactive, uncensored adult encounter. Ready to finish? Watch the climax scene and move on to the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful: Strip Royale isn\u2019t just about luck. Choose from powerful jokers at the start of each round to upgrade your deck, enhance your strategy, and gain an edge. Some jokers benefit only you, others shake up the match for both sides. Fail to hit the target score, and you\u2019ll lose your progress and your upgrades\u2014this is a true roguelike experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Classic Snap card mechanics with an adult twist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Realistic 3D models and fully animated explicit scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Roguelike progression: build your deck with powerful jokers, but risk losing everything on failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Unique sex scenes, positions, and animations for each girl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 For adults only: features full nudity and uncensored sexual content</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869360?t=1757686613","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima